<title>USA: Lescarden creditors approve plan.</title>
<headline>Lescarden creditors approve plan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lescarden Inc said on Tuesday that a committee representing all unsecured creditors has approved the company's reorganization plan.</p>
<p>The plan would retire all unsecured debt in exchange for the company's common stock, which will be valued at $0.40 or market, whichever is greater at the time the Bankruptcy Court confirms the plan, Lescarden said.</p>
<p>The plan must be reviewed by the Bankruptcy Court and is subject to a vote of all unsecured creditors and all shareholders, the company said. Lescarden said a vote is expected before the end of the year.</p>
</text>
